Very nice! Thanks Alex!

One minor thing: The Vagrant file needs unzip as well e.g.
config.vm.provision :shell, inline: "apt-get update && apt-get install openjdk-8-jdk maven make gcc-4.7 gcc-4.7-plugin-dev gfortran-4.7 g++-4.7 gcc-4.7.multilib g++-4.7-multilib unzip -y"

After adding that I managed to build everything in the downloader-fixes branch!

I am very happy now, thanks again!

Regards,
Per

